{
  "name": "ContextMenu",
  "group": "overlay",
  "description": "Menú contextual que se abre con clic derecho o pulsación larga sobre una zona.",
  "import": "import { ContextMenu, type MenuEntry } from \"@zuccadev-labs/zuix-zui\"",
  "props": [
    {
      "name": "children",
      "type": "ReactElement",
      "required": true,
      "description": "Zona sensible al clic derecho."
    },
    {
      "name": "items",
      "type": "MenuEntry[]",
      "required": true,
      "description": "Entradas: { id, label, icon?, shortcut?, danger?, disabled?, keepOpen?, onSelect?, items? } | { type: \"separator\" } | { type: \"label\", label }. `items` anida un submenú."
    },
    {
      "name": "label",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "name": "size",
      "type": "enum",
      "values": ["md", "lg"],
      "default": "md"
    },
    {
      "name": "disabled",
      "type": "boolean",
      "default": false
    },
    {
      "name": "onOpenChange",
      "type": "(open: boolean) => void"
    }
  ],
  "states": ["open", "closed", "highlighted", "disabled"],
  "tokens": [
    "duration-fast",
    "fg",
    "fg-muted",
    "fg-subtle",
    "font-mono",
    "font-sans",
    "glass-blur",
    "glass-border",
    "glass-highlight",
    "glass-saturate",
    "glass-shadow",
    "glass-specular",
    "layer-menu",
    "leading-normal",
    "line",
    "popup-bg",
    "popup-radius",
    "text-body",
    "weight-medium",
    "weight-regular",
    "accent-ring",
    "control-height-lg",
    "danger-soft",
    "danger-text",
    "duration-normal",
    "ease-emphasized",
    "ease-exit",
    "focus-width",
    "item-radius",
    "leading-ui",
    "popup-blur",
    "popup-shadow",
    "space-1",
    "space-1-5",
    "space-2",
    "space-2-5",
    "space-3",
    "space-4",
    "surface-2",
    "text-caption",
    "text-title",
    "touch-target",
    "tracking-wide"
  ],
  "classes": [
    "z-menu",
    "z-menu__item",
    "z-menu__icon",
    "z-menu__text",
    "z-menu__shortcut",
    "z-menu__separator",
    "z-menu__label",
    "z-menu__chevron"
  ],
  "a11y": "React: menú propio (patrón APG «menu»), que se abre en el puntero dentro de la ventana, también con la tecla de menú o Mayús+F10, y enfoca su primera entrada; flechas, Escape, submenús y roles de menú. Sin React (`@zuccadev-labs/zuix-zui/dom`): `data-z-context=\"#id\"` abre el menú en el puntero con clic derecho y enfoca su primera entrada; flechas, Inicio/Fin, búsqueda por letra, Tab y Escape como en Menu. Los submenús se declaran con `data-z-submenu=\"#id\"` y se manejan igual: Flecha derecha o Intro abren, Flecha izquierda o Escape cierran solo el submenú. La apertura con la tecla de menú o Mayús+F10 depende del evento `contextmenu` del navegador.",
  "examples": [
    {
      "title": "Sobre una tarjeta",
      "code": "<ContextMenu\n  label=\"File actions\"\n  items={[\n    { id: \"open\", label: \"Open\", onSelect: () => openFile() },\n    { id: \"move\", label: \"Move to\", items: [\n      { id: \"archive\", label: \"Archive\", onSelect: () => moveTo(\"archive\") },\n      { id: \"inbox\", label: \"Inbox\", onSelect: () => moveTo(\"inbox\") },\n    ] },\n    { type: \"separator\" },\n    { id: \"delete\", label: \"Delete\", danger: true, shortcut: \"Del\", onSelect: () => removeFile() },\n  ]}\n>\n  <div>Right-click this area</div>\n</ContextMenu>"
    }
  ],
  "origin": "ContextMenu y `.ctx-menu` de zutool (las subpáginas pasan a submenús); accesibilidad según el patrón APG, con primitivas propias.",
  "behavior": "dom",
  "html": [
    {
      "title": "Menú contextual con submenú anidado",
      "code": "<div class=\"z-liquid\" data-z-context=\"#file-menu\">Right-click here</div>\n\n<div id=\"file-menu\" popover class=\"z-liquid z-menu\" role=\"menu\" data-size=\"md\">\n  <button type=\"button\" role=\"menuitem\" class=\"z-menu__item\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n    <span class=\"z-menu__icon\"><z-icon name=\"pencil\" size=\"14\"></z-icon></span>\n    <span class=\"z-menu__text\">Rename</span>\n    <kbd class=\"z-menu__shortcut\">F2</kbd>\n  </button>\n  <button type=\"button\" role=\"menuitem\" class=\"z-menu__item\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n    <span class=\"z-menu__icon\"><z-icon name=\"document-duplicate\" size=\"14\"></z-icon></span>\n    <span class=\"z-menu__text\">Duplicate</span>\n  </button>\n  <button type=\"button\" role=\"menuitem\" class=\"z-menu__item\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-haspopup=\"menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"file-move\" data-z-submenu=\"#file-move\">\n    <span class=\"z-menu__icon\"><z-icon name=\"folder\" size=\"14\"></z-icon></span>\n    <span class=\"z-menu__text\">Move to</span>\n    <span class=\"z-menu__chevron\"><z-icon name=\"chevron-right\" size=\"14\"></z-icon></span>\n  </button>\n  <div id=\"file-move\" popover class=\"z-liquid z-menu\" role=\"menu\" aria-label=\"Move to\" data-size=\"md\">\n    <button type=\"button\" role=\"menuitem\" class=\"z-menu__item\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n      <span class=\"z-menu__icon\"><z-icon name=\"folder\" size=\"14\"></z-icon></span>\n      <span class=\"z-menu__text\">Documents</span>\n    </button>\n    <button type=\"button\" role=\"menuitem\" class=\"z-menu__item\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n      <span class=\"z-menu__icon\"><z-icon name=\"archive-box\" size=\"14\"></z-icon></span>\n      <span class=\"z-menu__text\">Archive</span>\n    </button>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"z-menu__separator\" role=\"separator\"></div>\n  <button type=\"button\" role=\"menuitem\" class=\"z-menu__item\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-danger>\n    <span class=\"z-menu__icon\"><z-icon name=\"trash\" size=\"14\"></z-icon></span>\n    <span class=\"z-menu__text\">Delete</span>\n  </button>\n</div>"
    }
  ]
}
